  "description_short": "Casual family spot in Great Brak River serving traditional South African fare with generous portions and friendly service.",
  "description_long": "OpiSpoor Restaurant sits in the quiet coastal village of Great Brak River, offering a relaxed setting for families and travelers exploring the Garden Route. The menu leans into South African comfort food with hearty portions that won't break the bank, making it a reliable stop for those seeking familiar flavors in a no-fuss atmosphere.\n\nThe restaurant's straightforward approach appeals to locals and visitors alike, with a menu that covers the bases from grills to pub-style meals. While it may not chase culinary trends, OpiSpoor delivers consistent plates in a comfortable setting where kids are welcome and the pace is unhurried. Its location near the Great Brak River mouth makes it a convenient pit stop for beachgoers and road-trippers heading along the N2.",
